verses.text:
It is written in the prophet Isaiah:{d}
“See, ahead of you I send my envoy,
who will prepare your path.

A voice of someone shouting in the wilderness:
‘Make ready the way of the Lord;
straighten out the paths he will take.’ ”

The people in front and the people behind were crying out,
“Hosanna!{e}
Blessed is he who comes in the name of the Lord!{f}

“But in those days, after that time of distress,
‘the sun will grow dark,
and the moon will not shed its light;

And Jesus told them, “All of you will stumble and fall away, because Scripture says:
‘I will strike down the shepherd,
and the sheep will be scattered.’{j}
